Error [E0973]: `windows.x64` isn't a platform Jet knows
  --> config.jet:1:32
    |
  1 | module m { system.s: { target: windows.x64 } }
    |                                ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: U13: a `target` is a typed platform value, not a piece of quoted text — it must be `linux.x64` or `linux.arm64`
 Fix: write `target: linux.x64` or `target: linux.arm64`
